        <h2>Live Trading Sessions (Leaked)</h2>
        <div class="videos-grid">
          <div class="video-card premium">
            <div class="thumbnail">🎬</div>
            <h3>Prop Firm Challenge Live Trading</h3>
            <p>Live trading sessions from funded trader challenges</p>
            <div class="meta">
