            </div>
            <div class="badge">Live Trades</div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="video-card">
            <div class="thumbnail">🎬</div>
            <h3>ICT Live Market Analysis</h3>
            <p>Real-time market analysis and trade setups</p>
            <div class="meta">
              <span>📹 25 videos</span>
              <span>⏱️ 50+ hours</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="video-card">
            <div class="thumbnail">🎬</div>
            <h3>SMC Live Trading Sessions</h3>
            <p>Live trades using Smart Money Concepts</p>
            <div class="meta">
              <span>📹 20 videos</span>
